  skillDescription: "<color=#FFD700>Base (1\u2605):</color> Rapid-fire sniper with lower per-shot damage. Gains +10% attack speed per enemy in range, capped at +100%.\n<color=#FFD700>1st upgrade (2\u2605):</color> Each landed hit against the same enemy ignores 1% of its DEF, stacking to 100%; switching targets resets this bonus.\n<color=#FFD700>2nd upgrade (3\u2605):</color> Increases the attack-speed passive to +30% per enemy, capped at +300%."
